 on social media","summary":"Multiple social media posts express admiration for the beauty, cuteness, stage presence, and vocal performances of K-pop idols Hyeongwon, Dongheon, and Narita Kakinai. Comments highlight mesmerizing appearances, impressive arms, sparkly outfits in shared photos and videos. Hashtags like #웇앤 and date codes such as 261008 reflect fan enthusiasm for recent content.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T07:15:33.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108455327037583704"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108177934444003376"},{"post_id":"2108214411341218112"},{"post_id":"2108343333722685850"},{"post_id":"2108334197626798403"},{"post_id":"2108276730557530465"},{"post_id":"2108177934444003376"},{"post_id":"2108343700883722271"},{"post_id":"2108214411341218112"},{"post_id":"2108267702070726683"},{"post_id":"2108243541600457149"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Music"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"Fans are buzzing over dramatic close-ups and videos from BTS's packed stadium show in Lima, Peru, capturing the idols' raw energy and stage command.","id":"2108363967076700643","name":"BTS ARIRANG Tour Lights Up Lima with Stunning Fan Captures","summary":"BTS rocked Estadio San Marcos on October 7 as part of their ARIRANG World Tour supporting the 2026 album, marking their full-group return after military service. Supporters shared standout moments like intense vocals, mesmerizing expressions, and group shots with smoke and lights, with reactions ranging from 'one of the girls ☆' to 'I got cuteness aggression from this video.' Credits went to tour photographer pierocolomer for sharp images, while playful tags like 'never behind holic' kept the communal vibe alive. These posts highlight the deep connection between the group and their global fans as the Latin American leg continues.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T04:33:22.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108363967076700643"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108465372810940883"},{"post_id":"2108524569929650323"},{"post_id":"2108518234999984324"},{"post_id":"2108494361981780217"},{"post_id":"2108475945896345689"},{"post_id":"2108506169606332421"},{"post_id":"2108471580380762512"},{"post_id":"2108489937846935761"},{"post_id":"2108513758263832857"},{"post_id":"2108494487903412585"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Celebrity"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","id":"2108549710453805383","name":"Pooja Hegde attends Lifestyle Store launch event in Begumpet, Hyderabad","summary":"Actress Pooja Hegde attended the launch event of a Lifestyle Store in Begumpet, Hyderabad. She received a grand reception from large crowds of fans, interacted with them by taking selfies, and participated in a pre-birthday cake-cutting celebration. She wore Indian fusion wear and black attire.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T16:56:19.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108549710453805383"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108343700883722271"},{"post_id":"2108499603251507574"},{"post_id":"2108405812896936420"},{"post_id":"2108405815182803420"},{"post_id":"2108531072510370153"},{"post_id":"2108412179208630554"},{"post_id":"2108349728778072545"},{"post_id":"2108459989094613457"},{"post_id":"2108359589041500648"},{"post_id":"2108414046479503800"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Music","K-pop"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","id":"2108497738891661552","name":"BTS Members Jungkook and Jimin Release New Content and Appearances","summary":"BTS members Jungkook and Jimin released new content and made appearances. Fans praised Jungkook's beauty, voice, stage presence, and aura through clips and images. Discussions referenced a female performer called '2yulz,' sparkly shoes, and hashtag #서경배.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T12:34:34.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108497738891661552"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108439563463233643"},{"post_id":"2108428034693050772"},{"post_id":"2108423302423429448"},{"post_id":"2108444079944319253"},{"post_id":"2108420989256413557"},{"post_id":"2108449308723036291"},{"post_id":"2108422106052776250"},{"post_id":"2108453750117675154"},{"post_id":"2108417285040074964"},{"post_id":"2108507766755127328"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Movies & TV"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","id":"2108459112589861268","name":"Weibo TV & Internet Video Summit 2026 nominations announced for dramas, characters, OSTs, and actors","summary":"Multiple Chinese dramas including Live Up To Your Youth, Swords Into Plowshares, and Zhan Zhao Adventures received nominations in categories such as Best Drama Series, Best Characters, Best CP, and Best OST. Actors like Sun Qian, Bai Lu, Bai Yu, Zhang Ruonan, Yang Yang, and Liu Yuning earned nominations for their roles and contributions. Fans are urged to vote for their favorites on Weibo ahead of the summit.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T14:34:46.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108459112589861268"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108245397819023664"},{"post_id":"2108289061329019261"},{"post_id":"2108339874143392243"},{"post_id":"2108308834011812250"},{"post_id":"2108258091745648743"},{"post_id":"2108245397819023664"},{"post_id":"2108289061329019261"},{"post_id":"2108309273910575177"},{"post_id":"2108339874143392243"},{"post_id":"2108234323010748583"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Movies & TV"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"White performers took all the top acting prizes at this year's Emmys, echoing old complaints about a lack of on-screen representation.","id":"2108305881167442013","name":"Hollywood Reporter Flags TV Diversity Regression After Emmy Sweep","summary":"A Hollywood Reporter article highlights a rollback in TV diversity, with UCLA data showing lead actors of color in streaming series dropping from 51 percent in 2024 to 36 percent in 2025. Television Academy chair Cris Abrego called it a real regression, while UCLA's Ana-Christina Ramón said studios now treat diversity as optional despite growing diverse audiences. Online views differ: some see scary trends in mostly white projects, others argue it should remain optional, as successes like The Pitt and Abbott Elementary show strong multi-ethnic casts can still thrive.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T00:10:56.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108305881167442013"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108343700883722271"},{"post_id":"2108343333722685850"},{"post_id":"2108287262920495314"},{"post_id":"2108279187152969916"},{"post_id":"2108270765921505560"},{"post_id":"2108343700883722271"},{"post_id":"2108243541600457149"},{"post_id":"2108276730557530465"},{"post_id":"2108334197626798403"},{"post_id":"2108343333722685850"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Music","K-pop"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"Over 60,000 ARMYs packed Mexico City's Estadio GNP on October 8, cheering as BTS delivered high-energy performances in crisp white outfits under dramatic lights and pyrotechnics.","id":"2108433200393372042","name":"BTS ARIRANG Tour Thrills Fans in Latin America","summary":"The septet kicked off their ARIRANG World Tour earlier this year, drawing massive crowds with sharp choreography, standout vocals, and outfits from casual hoodies to flowing stage wear. Fans share endless clips from Mexico City, Lima, and beyond, praising moments like a member's glowing smile under stage lights and passionate deliveries that remind everyone why they love performing. One fan captured the obsession perfectly: 'never behind holic.' These highlights blend powerful singing, precise dance, and genuine joy, resonating deeply with audiences this fall.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T05:48:22.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108433200393372042"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108087798263959595"},{"post_id":"2108081680724676797"},{"post_id":"2108184729086513467"},{"post_id":"2108183948371304821"},{"post_id":"2108102213104988504"},{"post_id":"2108117929023975566"},{"post_id":"2108499603251507574"},{"post_id":"2108087798263959595"},{"post_id":"2108102213104988504"},{"post_id":"2108343700883722271"}],"contexts":{"topics":["K-pop"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"Jimin owned the 360-degree stage at Estadio San Marcos, blending explosive energy with flawless dance moves that fans captured in stunning fancams.","id":"2108235579976491349","name":"Fans Celebrate Jimin's Explosive Performance in Lima","summary":"During BTS's Arirang World Tour stop in Lima on October 7, Jimin delivered a commanding show full of precise choreography and emotional depth, leaving fans in awe. From his early days as a top dance student in Busan—nicknamed 'The Rising Star'—to joining BTS as lead vocalist and main dancer, his journey shone through as he thanked the crowd in Spanish with 'Los amo.' Fans shared heartfelt reactions, grateful for fancams that preserve these moments from the Busan dancer turned global stage genius.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T06:37:05.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108235579976491349"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108334197626798403"},{"post_id":"2108405815182803420"},{"post_id":"2108336428698734715"},{"post_id":"2108349728778072545"},{"post_id":"2108414046479503800"},{"post_id":"2108439669121954218"},{"post_id":"2108370817461727408"},{"post_id":"2108364629051322539"},{"post_id":"2108359466454495533"},{"post_id":"2108292047715328030"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Concerts"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","id":"2108466732436226181","name":"Fans react enthusiastically to concert performance featuring impressive shots, edit transitions, outfits, and vocals","summary":"Social media users shared clips and photos from a concert, praising a standout shot by pierocolomer, genius edit transitions on screens, one of the performer's best looks, exceptional vocal performance, and strong arms display. Reactions included expressions of awe, obsession, chills, and emotional responses like happy tears. Discussion highlighted specific moments described as tight, rockstar-like, and priceless, with references to songs like 'one of the girls'.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:00:55.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108466732436226181"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108343700883722271"},{"post_id":"2108243541600457149"},{"post_id":"2108276730557530465"},{"post_id":"2108334197626798403"},{"post_id":"2108343333722685850"},{"post_id":"2108385903056150781"},{"post_id":"2108349728778072545"},{"post_id":"2108336428698734715"},{"post_id":"2108279187152969916"},{"post_id":"2108293425829482772"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Concerts"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"Fans are buzzing with close-up shots of BTS members owning the stage at Lima's Estadio San Marcos, from Jimin's stunning looks to the group's tight choreography under dramatic lights.","id":"2108426711314673872","name":"BTS Fans Light Up Over Powerful ‘ARIRANG’ Tour Moments in Lima","summary":"BTS kicked off the Latin American leg of their World Tour ‘ARIRANG’ with back-to-back shows on October 9 and 10 in Peru, drawing waves of fan posts praising intense vocals, playful expressions, and emotional crowd connections. Jimin earned special shoutouts for his delivery and visuals, while clips of cute moments sparked reactions like “I’m crying” and “cuteness aggression.” The tour heads next to Chile and Brazil with hits like “MIC Drop,” as shared photos and videos capture the production's scale and genius screen transitions.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T05:24:16.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108426711314673872"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108628538576531866"},{"post_id":"2108617852433354807"},{"post_id":"2108627890640388137"},{"post_id":"2108698749371347297"},{"post_id":"2108644088622850393"},{"post_id":"2108626264030654954"},{"post_id":"2108661258258157820"},{"post_id":"2108671080147636253"},{"post_id":"2108631714520060054"},{"post_id":"2108663932936487037"}],"contexts":{"topics":["K-pop"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","id":"2108701996580769901","name":"ENHYPEN's Ni-ki Expresses Discomfort on Weverse Over Secret Filming of Him and Friend at Concert","summary":"Ni-ki of ENHYPEN posted on Weverse DM expressing frustration that someone secretly filmed him and his friend at a concert. He suggested fans talk to them politely instead of filming secretly. Fans urged others to delete related videos and posts out of respect for his privacy and boundaries.","updated_at":"2026-10-10T01:33:37.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108701996580769901"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108472957836369940"},{"post_id":"2108497584587424193"},{"post_id":"2108475137964339636"},{"post_id":"2108413241009602874"},{"post_id":"2108499194344583264"},{"post_id":"2108465449243652237"},{"post_id":"2108464972699492562"},{"post_id":"2108471340596654225"},{"post_id":"2108484500368085325"},{"post_id":"2108476830852243929"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Movies & TV"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","id":"2108508973280489714","name":"Gemini Norawit Titicharoenrak Named Thailand's National Winner for Best Actor in a Leading Role at 2026 Asian Academy Creative Awards for 'Ticket to Heaven'","summary":"Gemini Norawit Titicharoenrak won the 2026 National Winner award for Best Actor in a Leading Role for his performance in 'Ticket to Heaven.' He will represent Thailand at the Asian Academy Creative Awards Grand Gala Final on December 3rd, competing for the Golden Statuette.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T13:41:28.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108508973280489714"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108092414447804452"},{"post_id":"2107984441985622140"},{"post_id":"2108116158033567811"},{"post_id":"2107669942133043331"},{"post_id":"2108130805449154628"},{"post_id":"2108053230710321210"},{"post_id":"2107675170584576328"},{"post_id":"2108018838881304591"},{"post_id":"2108092317039198360"},{"post_id":"2108034886213001654"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Celebrity"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"Paulo Avelino stepped onto the KBS Hall stage in Seoul, emotional as he thanked his team and fans for his win in 'The Alibi.' His modern Barong Tagalog on the red carpet proudly showcased Philippine culture.","id":"2107676175350878545","name":"Paulo Avelino Wins Outstanding Asian Star at Seoul Drama Awards","summary":"Filipino actor Paulo Avelino received the Outstanding Asian Star award at the 2026 Seoul International Drama Awards on October 8 for his role in the romance-mystery series 'The Alibi.' Selected through global fan voting, he accepted the honor in person after arriving in South Korea earlier that week, marking the fifth straight year a Kapamilya star has won the prize. In his speech, Paulo expressed gratitude to ABS-CBN, Prime Video, the 'Alibi' creators, and supporters, while fans celebrated his classy presence and the achievement for Philippine talent alongside winners like BLACKPINK's Jisoo.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T00:57:15.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2107676175350878545"},{"category":"Other","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108428630426611999"},{"post_id":"2108426931851157965"},{"post_id":"2108426136862822708"},{"post_id":"2108428099948081161"},{"post_id":"2108430320131285033"},{"post_id":"2108427102676463725"},{"post_id":"2108432268255695332"},{"post_id":"2108463369753616894"},{"post_id":"2108439033923744204"},{"post_id":"2108429578620502412"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Education"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","id":"2108464868399407484","name":"Olive School Drama Club Students Perform Spoken-Word Piece 'A Nation in Many Voices' Celebrating Uganda","summary":"Drama club students from Olive School performed a spoken-word piece titled 'A Nation in Many Voices' expressing patriotism by highlighting Uganda, its people, and its story. The video of the performance received widespread online praise for the students' creativity, sharpness, and articulate delivery.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T07:53:05.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108464868399407484"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108364479390191722"},{"post_id":"2108316586662617133"},{"post_id":"2108348631237730470"},{"post_id":"2108316246928450016"},{"post_id":"2108309521206747558"},{"post_id":"2108364479390191722"},{"post_id":"2108316586662617133"},{"post_id":"2108238988104609959"},{"post_id":"2108316246928450016"},{"post_id":"2108309521206747558"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Movies & TV"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"One fan sobbed at their office desk over a heartfelt scene, capturing the quiet ache many are feeling right now.","id":"2108385765134635107","name":"People Share Raw Moments of Sadness and Tears Online","summary":"Users are opening up with unfiltered posts about grief, longing, and tears triggered by anime clips, personal memories, esports moments, and quiet photos of despair. Captions like 'i miss them so bad i feel sick to my stomach' and 'let yourself grieve it' reveal physical reactions to loss and vulnerability. This wave of shared sorrow builds connection, as people find comfort in knowing others feel the same weight of unprocessed emotions.","updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:40:48.000Z","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2108385765134635107"},{"category":"Entertainment","cluster_posts_results":[{"post_id":"2108260149496615082"},{"post_id":"2107584990481420345"},{"post_id":"2108280088458641669"},{"post_id":"2108274356539277351"},{"post_id":"2108320971384029249"},{"post_id":"2108654786526781718"},{"post_id":"2108652321114620069"},{"post_id":"2108675189571834321"},{"post_id":"2108615603733033120"},{"post_id":"2108260149496615082"}],"contexts":{"topics":["Movies & TV"]},"disclaimer":"This story is a summary of posts on X and may evolve over time. Grok can make mistakes, verify its outputs.","hook":"A single mom and a reformed ex-con find connection through letters after a prison riot – that's the heartfelt hook of Tyler Perry's new Netflix drama drawing strong reactions.","id":"2108336416682017243","name":"Tyler Perry's 'Doing Life' Resonates with Viewers on Netflix","summary":"Released on Netflix October 2, 2026, 'Doing Life' follows Anika, a former correctional officer played by Naomi Baker, and Carousel, an ex-convict portrayed by Jay Reeves, as they build a bond amid family challenges and judgment. Fans praise its emotional depth on redemption, authentic love, and second chances, with many calling it Tyler Perry's best yet for scenes of quiet walks and raw moments. While professional reviews are mixed and some viewers criticize it harshly, the 